{"id":"en_a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire","title":"A Blood Oath to the Vampire","titleEn":"A Blood Oath to the Vampire","description":"After losing her job, Sara is evicted with nowhere to turn. In desperation, she takes a million-dollar position as a submissive slave and arrives at Drake Manor, where she meets the enigmatic Lucien Drake. Their arrangement as dom and sub soon turns steamy, but Sara uncovers Lucien's dark truth: he is a vampire concealing something dangerous in his tower. Despite their growing love, the real threat in the manor proves to be Bianca, Lucien's jealous maid, who is determined to become his eternal bride. Sara must overcome Bianca to secure her happy ending, even if it costs her life. A Blood Oath to the Vampire can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtyeq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtyeq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtyeq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtyeq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-blood-oath-to-the-vampire_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number"